, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011iufaA2Lf3o7qWgPfNeMY9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 384281, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01B4L1bH9nAtbVKsCt3s6peg", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0002"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 743030, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01B4L1bH9nAtbVKsCt3s6peg", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 743030, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01B4L1bH9nAtbVKsCt3s6peg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 746922, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CJ5PVnfzSxjcRKzAzitc8f", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-round-half-even", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py` expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but `round_money` in `src/money.py` was using `ROUND_HALF_UP` \u2014 contradicting its own docstring.\n\n## Change\n- `src/money.py`: switch `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\n## Verification\n- Branch updated with latest main.\n- CI run `ci-0002` on `0a9452f727`: **passed**.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even-v2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 747822, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CJ5PVnfzSxjcRKzAzitc8f", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even-v2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 747822, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CJ5PVnfzSxjcRKzAzitc8f", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 752022, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary:\n\n**Root cause:** `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP` in `round_money`, even though its docstring (and FIN-212) call for banker's rounding. The test `round_money(Decimal(\"2.665\")) == Decimal(\"2.66\")` fails under half-up.\n\n**What I did:**\n1. Created branch `fix/money-round-half-even` from main.\n2. Changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (one-line fix plus import).\n3. Ran CI (`ci-0001`) \u2014 passed.\n4. The PR was initially rejected because main had moved ahead, so I merged latest main into the branch (`0a9452f727`), confirmed the fix was intact, and re-ran CI (`ci-0002`) \u2014 passed.\n5. Opened **PR #101** against main with alex requested as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI did not merge the PR, since merging into main requires code-owner approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014Lr17yTV7NzLqbXwWPkC1L", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XjtZT5fbiDoon7KuTJsq3L", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN but the code uses ROUND_HALF_UP. I'll create a branch and fix it.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014ksErc3vmv69CFJCQ4VxwP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01